<div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">48.4 s</div><div class="stat-label">Women, mean of three hangs (14 women, SD 29.1 s)</div><div class="stat-source"><a href="https://doi.org/10.3390/jfmk10040427" rel="noopener">GRIP-6 STUDY, 2025</a></div></div>
<div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-value">120 s</div><div class="stat-label">Attia's "at least" target for a very strong 40-year-old man (90 s for a woman)</div><div class="stat-source"><a href="https://peterattiamd.com/specialama/" rel="noopener">THE DRIVE #329, DEC 2024</a></div></div>
